ck, and alternative festival held in September.\n\n**Dining near Red Rocks:**\n- **BBQ**: GQue BBQ, Dinosaur Bar-B-Que, Moe's Original BBQ, Big B's Delicious BBQ, or Wayne's Smoke Shack.\n- **Walking Distance to Red Rocks**: The Ship Rock Grille (which has a patio with views of the amphitheater), The Village Tavern, or the Morrison Inn.","input_tokens":19569,"latency_ms":561308,"output_tokens":1296,"question_id":"a89d7624","scored":true,"source_category":"single-session-preference","usd":0.009110700000000003},{"abstained":false,"answer_type":"direct","category":"temporal","claims":[{"claim_id":"clm_l3dP_V89y6FmVbJ3LatLt","claim_type":"person.event","object":"rode the new Star Wars: Rise of the Resistance ride at Disneyland with my family","status":"accepted","subject":"person:user","valid_from":"2023-01-15T00:00:00Z"},{"claim_id":"clm_pLtvZDQfP1s3Hd9_jazKB","claim_type":"person.fact","object":"has not played the video games","status":"accepted","subject":"person:user","valid_from":"2023-05-25T13:41:00Z"},{"claim_id":"clm_rsbRGDwHrsBAt0JGbh-Us","claim_type":"person.fact","object":"has not read the books","status":"accepted","subject":"person:user","valid_from":"2023-05-25T13:41:00Z"},{"claim_id":"clm_VrcR0G9raV2TsFXRIc5lo","claim_type":"person.event","object":"bought a black backpack with multiple compartments","status":"accepted","subject":"person:user","valid_from":"2023-05-04T00:00:00Z"},{"claim_id":"clm_wEGqFBEIYMknmfgEB6YME","claim_type":"person.event","object":"added a new credit card to my wallet","status":"accepted","subject":"person:user","valid_from":"2023-05-25T08:39:00Z"},{"claim_id":"clm_UxaHMggOmw1Ipr49OMUtX","claim_type":"person.event","object":"new backpack from the outlet store in the mall for $80","status":"accepted","subject":"person:user","valid_from":"2023-03-10T00:00:00Z"},{"claim_id":"clm_aHue6hSc8hwSuylzozIr0","claim_type":"person.event","object":"headphones from Amazon","status":"accepted","subject":"person:user","valid_from":"2023-05-17T00:0